<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS FEB NET RISES TO PLN 4.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS FEB NET RISES TO PLN 4.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.06 vs   0.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.55 vs   1.57</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.20 vs   1.58</p>
<p> Sales		   46.32 vs  37.67</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.24 vs   1.77</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.45 vs   3.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.28 vs   3.30</p>
<p> Sales		   70.06 vs  77.89</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer maker is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
